              "value": "crb"
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "A fortification rune wards against the most deadly attacks.\n\nEach time you're critically hit while wearing the etched armor, attempt a DC 17 flat check. On a success, it becomes a normal hit. This property thickens the armor, increasing its Bulk by 1 and the Strength required to reduce its penalties by 2.\n\nThe flat check DC is 14."
